# Integer16 remainder promotes mixed operands

Verifies int8 and int16 remainder promotes to int16 while preserving the
source operand order.

>>> source
narrow: int8 = 20
wide: int16 = 5

narrow_left: int16 = narrow % wide
wide_left: int16 = wide % narrow
print(narrow_left)
print(wide_left)

<<< stdout
0
5

<<< stderr
